# SPA fallback for a direct-upload Pages project.
#
# Cloudflare Pages reads routing from `_redirects` in the *uploaded* directory;
# a `[[redirects]]` table in wrangler.toml is never installed by
# `wrangler pages deploy`, so without this file every client route 404s on a
# hard refresh (/data, /tokens, /sign-in). Existing files (assets, index.html)
# are served first, so this only catches deep links.
